cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use dyadMLM, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "dyadMLM: Tools for Dyadic Multilevel Models"
authors:
  - family-names: "Küng"
    given-names: "Pascal"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0000-0001-7346-9414"
    affiliation: "University of Zurich"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Pascal-Kueng/dyadMLM"
url: "https://pascal-kueng.github.io/dyadMLM/"
doi: "10.5281/zenodo.22047083"
abstract: >-
  dyadMLM provides tools for dyadic multilevel modeling with linear and
  generalized linear mixed-effects models. It validates and prepares
  cross-sectional and intensive longitudinal dyadic data for Actor-Partner
  Interdependence Model (APIM), Dyad-Individual Model (DIM), and Dyadic Score
  Model (DSM) parameterizations. It also provides selected tools for model
  comparison and covariance back-transformation.
keywords:
  - dyadic data
  - multilevel models
  - APIM
  - distinguishable dyads
  - exchangeable dyads
  - mixed-composition dyads
license: MIT
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-08-21
